Name: hunspell
URL: http://hunspell.sourceforge.net/
Version: v1.7.5
Update Mechanism: Manual
CPEPrefix: cpe:/a:hunspell_project:hunspell
License: MPL-1.1
License Android Compatible: yes
License File: src/COPYING.MPL
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
This is a partial copy of Hunspell: the upstream license files,
README.md, src/hunspell/ and src/parsers/, without the Makefile.am files,
src/hunspell/utf_info.hxx and src/parsers/.gitignore.

All dictionaries used by Chromium has been checked in to the
'third_party/hunspell_dictionaries' directory. They have several additions over
the default myspell/hunspell dictionaries.
(See 'third_party/hunspell_dictionaries/README.chromium' for their details.)

Local Modifications:
The patches are in patches/; copy.bara.sky applies them in this order.
0001-bdict-reader.patch: Read dictionaries from BDICT data (read by google/)
  instead of .aff/.dic files, under HUNSPELL_CHROME_CLIENT.
0002-undef-near.patch: Undefine the near macro in replist.hxx.
0003-checkword-length-check.patch: Reject too long words in
  HunspellImpl::checkword.
0004-max-utf8-word-length.patch: Reduce the maximum UTF-8 word length to
  2 * MAXWORDLEN.
0005-replist-insertion-sort.patch: Sort RepList entries by swapping.
0006-checkword-time-limit.patch: Skip the per-candidate time limit
  check that upstream afde4d6 added to SuggestMgr::checkword.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
